{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-apis","title":"平台 API 访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/platform-apis","wordCount":634,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"平台-api-访问\">平台 API 访问</h1><p>在 Kotlin Multiplatform 项目中，访问各平台原生 API 是不可避免的需求。从文件系统到传感器、从数据库到网络，每个平台都有自己的 API 生态。KMP 提供了多种策略来桥接共享代码与平台特定功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>平台 API 访问的核心是<strong>在共享层与平台层之间划定一条窄接口</strong>：公共代码只依赖接口或 <code>expect</code> 声明，平台侧提供实现并通过依赖注入在入口组装，从而把平台差异收敛到少数边界文件。对文件、传感器、数据库、网络等能力，选型的原则是优先使用跨平台库，仅在必要时才落到 native 互操作。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"平台模块设计模式\">平台模块设计模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[共享代码 commonMain] --&gt; B{需要平台 API?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[定义接口/expect]&#10;    C --&gt; D[各平台提供 actual/实现]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| E[直接在 commonMain 使用]&#10;    D --&gt; F[通过依赖注入组装]\">flowchart TD\n    A[共享代码 commonMain] --&gt; B{需要平台 API?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[定义接口/expect]\n    C --&gt; D[各平台提供 actual/实现]\n    B --&gt;|否| E[直接在 commonMain 使用]\n    D --&gt; F[通过依赖注入组装]</pre><p>三种访问平台 API 的策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>expect/actual</td>\n<td>简单的平台差异</td>\n<td>编译时检查</td>\n<td>每个 expect 需要所有平台 actual</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口 + DI</td>\n<td>复杂的平台服务</td>\n<td>灵活、可测试</td>\n<td>需要 DI 框架配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台库</td>\n<td>通用功能</td>\n<td>零平台代码</td>\n<td>库功能可能不完整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖注入方式\">依赖注入方式</h2><p>通过接口定义服务契约，各平台注入具体实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain — 服务接口&#10;interface FileStorage {&#10;    suspend fun readText(path: String): String&#10;    suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String)&#10;    suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LocationService {&#10;    suspend fun getCurrentLocation(): Location?&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class Location(val latitude: Double, val longitude: Double)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain — 服务接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface FileStorage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun readText(path: String): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface LocationService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getCurrentLocation(): Location?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Location(val latitude: Double, val longitude: Double)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// androidMain — Android 实现&#10;class AndroidFileStorage(private val context: Context) : FileStorage {&#10;    override suspend fun readText(path: String): String {&#10;        return File(context.filesDir, path).readText()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String) {&#10;        File(context.filesDir, path).writeText(content)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean {&#10;        return File(context.filesDir, path).exists()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain — Android 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AndroidFileStorage(private val context: Context) : FileStorage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun readText(path: String): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return File(context.filesDir, path).readText()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        File(context.filesDir, path).writeText(content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return File(context.filesDir, path).exists()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain — iOS 实现&#10;class IosFileStorage : FileStorage {&#10;    private val fileManager = NSFileManager.defaultManager&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun readText(path: String): String {&#10;        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(&#10;            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true&#10;        ).first() as String&#10;        val fullPath = &quot;$documentsPath/$path&quot;&#10;        return NSString.stringWithContentsOfFile(fullPath, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null) ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String) {&#10;        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(&#10;            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true&#10;        ).first() as String&#10;        (content as NSString).writeToFile(&#10;            &quot;$documentsPath/$path&quot;, true, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean {&#10;        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(&#10;            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true&#10;        ).first() as String&#10;        return fileManager.fileExistsAtPath(&quot;$documentsPath/$path&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain — iOS 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class IosFileStorage : FileStorage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fileManager = NSFileManager.defaultManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun readText(path: String): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).first() as String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val fullPath = \"$documentsPath/$path\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NSString.stringWithContentsOfFile(fullPath, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null) ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun writeText(path: String, content: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).first() as String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (content as NSString).writeToFile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"$documentsPath/$path\", true, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun exists(path: String): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val documentsPath = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NSDocumentDirectory, NSUserDomainMask, true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).first() as String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return fileManager.fileExistsAtPath(\"$documentsPath/$path\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ktor-跨平台网络\">Ktor 跨平台网络</h2><p>Ktor 是 KMP 中最成熟的跨平台网络库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;class ApiClient(private val httpClient: HttpClient) {&#10;    suspend fun fetchUsers(): List&lt;User&gt; {&#10;        return httpClient.get(&quot;https://api.example.com/users&quot;).body()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun createUser(user: User): User {&#10;        return httpClient.post(&quot;https://api.example.com/users&quot;) {&#10;            contentType(ContentType.Application.Json)&#10;            setBody(user)&#10;        }.body()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// commonMain — 共享配置&#10;expect fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Android) {&#10;    install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }&#10;    install(Logging) { level = LogLevel.BODY }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Darwin) {&#10;    install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }&#10;    install(Logging) { level = LogLevel.BODY }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ApiClient(private val httpClient: HttpClient) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun fetchUsers(): List&#x3C;User> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return httpClient.get(\"https://api.example.com/users\").body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun createUser(user: User): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return httpClient.post(\"https://api.example.com/users\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentType(ContentType.Application.Json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            setBody(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain — 共享配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Android) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(Logging) { level = LogLevel.BODY }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createPlatformHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Darwin) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(Logging) { level = LogLevel.BODY }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Ktor 的核心 API 完全跨平台，只有引擎（Android/Darwin/CIO）是平台特定的。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sqldelight-跨平台数据库\">SQLDelight 跨平台数据库</h2><p>SQLDelight 从 SQL 生成类型安全的 Kotlin API，完美支持 KMP：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- commonMain/sqldelight/com/example/User.sq&#10;CREATE TABLE User (&#10;    id INTEGER NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    email TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;selectAll:&#10;SELECT * FROM User;&#10;&#10;insert:&#10;INSERT INTO User(id, name, email) VALUES (?, ?, ?);&#10;&#10;findByName:&#10;SELECT * FROM User WHERE name LIKE ?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- commonMain/sqldelight/com/example/User.sq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">selectAll:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User(id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (?, ?, ?);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">findByName:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain — 使用生成的 API&#10;class UserRepository(private val database: AppDatabase) {&#10;    fun getAllUsers(): Flow&lt;List&lt;User&gt;&gt; {&#10;        return database.userQueries.selectAll().asFlow().mapToList(Dispatchers.IO)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun addUser(id: Long, name: String, email: String) {&#10;        database.userQueries.insert(id, name, email)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain — 使用生成的 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserRepository(private val database: AppDatabase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getAllUsers(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;User>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return database.userQueries.selectAll().asFlow().mapToList(Dispatchers.IO)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun addUser(id: Long, name: String, email: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        database.userQueries.insert(id, name, email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各平台提供数据库驱动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// androidMain&#10;actual fun createDriver(context: Context): SqlDriver {&#10;    return AndroidSqliteDriver(AppDatabase.Schema, context, &quot;app.db&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun createDriver(): SqlDriver {&#10;    return NativeSqliteDriver(AppDatabase.Schema, &quot;app.db&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createDriver(context: Context): SqlDriver {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return AndroidSqliteDriver(AppDatabase.Schema, context, \"app.db\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createDriver(): SqlDriver {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return NativeSqliteDriver(AppDatabase.Schema, \"app.db\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"native-互操作\">Native 互操作</h2><p>Kotlin/Native 可以直接调用 C 和 Objective-C API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain — 直接使用 Apple 框架&#10;import platform.Foundation.*&#10;import platform.UIKit.*&#10;import platform.CoreLocation.*&#10;&#10;class IosLocationService : LocationService {&#10;    override suspend fun getCurrentLocation(): Location? = suspendCancellableCoroutine { cont -&gt;&#10;        val manager = CLLocationManager()&#10;        manager.requestWhenInUseAuthorization()&#10;        manager.delegate = object : NSObject(), CLLocationManagerDelegateProtocol {&#10;            override fun locationManager(manager: CLLocationManager, didUpdateLocations: List&lt;*&gt;) {&#10;                val loc = didUpdateLocations.firstOrNull() as? CLLocation&#10;                cont.resume(loc?.let { Location(it.coordinate.latitude, it.coordinate.longitude) })&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        manager.requestLocation()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain — 直接使用 Apple 框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.Foundation.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.UIKit.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.CoreLocation.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class IosLocationService : LocationService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getCurrentLocation(): Location? = suspendCancellableCoroutine { cont -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val manager = CLLocationManager()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        manager.requestWhenInUseAuthorization()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        manager.delegate = object : NSObject(), CLLocationManagerDelegateProtocol {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun locationManager(manager: CLLocationManager, didUpdateLocations: List&#x3C;*>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val loc = didUpdateLocations.firstOrNull() as? CLLocation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                cont.resume(loc?.let { Location(it.coordinate.latitude, it.coordinate.longitude) })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        manager.requestLocation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Kotlin/Native] --&gt;|cinterop| B[C 库]&#10;    A --&gt;|直接调用| C[Objective-C 框架]&#10;    A --&gt;|通过 SKIE| D[Swift API]&#10;    E[Kotlin/JVM] --&gt;|JNI| F[Java/Android API]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Kotlin/Native] --&gt;|cinterop| B[C 库]\n    A --&gt;|直接调用| C[Objective-C 框架]\n    A --&gt;|通过 SKIE| D[Swift API]\n    E[Kotlin/JVM] --&gt;|JNI| F[Java/Android API]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台库生态\">跨平台库生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能领域</th>\n<th>推荐库</th>\n<th>平台支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>Ktor</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>SQLDelight</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>kotlinx.serialization</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期时间</td>\n<td>kotlinx-datetime</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设置存储</td>\n<td>multiplatform-settings</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片加载</td>\n<td>Coil (KMP)</td>\n<td>Android + iOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>Kermit</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DI</td>\n<td>Koin</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>访问平台 API 有三种策略：<strong>expect/actual</strong>、<strong>接口 + DI</strong>、<strong>跨平台库</strong></li>\n<li><strong>接口 + 依赖注入</strong>是处理复杂平台服务的推荐方式，支持测试和灵活替换</li>\n<li><strong>Ktor</strong> 提供完整的跨平台网络能力，核心 API 完全共享</li>\n<li><strong>SQLDelight</strong> 从 SQL 生成类型安全的跨平台数据库 API</li>\n<li>Kotlin/Native 可直接调用 C 和 Objective-C API，实现原生互操作</li>\n<li>KMP 库生态日趋完善，覆盖网络、数据库、序列化、DI 等核心领域</li>\n<li>优先使用跨平台库，其次使用接口抽象，最后才考虑 expect/actual</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台 API 访问","id":"平台-api-访问"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平台模块设计模式","id":"平台模块设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖注入方式","id":"依赖注入方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Ktor 跨平台网络","id":"ktor-跨平台网络"},{"level":2,"text":"SQLDelight 跨平台数据库","id":"sqldelight-跨平台数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"Native 互操作","id":"native-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台库生态","id":"跨平台库生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共享 UI (Compose Multiplatform)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/shared-ui-compose-mp"},"next":{"title":"委托","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/delegation"}}